        "reason": "Input description contained the expression ${{ job.status }}. GitHub evaluates expressions in action metadata and the job context is not available there, so every job using this action failed to load it (first live run, porchlight PR #9). Description changed to plain text; behavior unchanged."
      },
      {
        "path": ".github/scripts/asset_scan.py",
