        "reason": "XML-DTD refused Apple's standard public plist DOCTYPE in every Info.plist (critical false positive, porchlight PR #9). Exactly that declaration, once, with no ENTITY and no internal subset, is now removed before parsing; every other DOCTYPE, ENTITY or internal subset stays critical (ci/test-asset-plist.py)."
      },
      {
        "path": ".github/scripts/count_blocking.py",
        "from_sha256": "8ffb8d705cbcf21263fe6fc8a9d05f2d9f53402cec379b517ebdfb85ec72be28",
